'''Sakura''' (さくら, '''''Sakura''''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy from the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Sakura
|image = E 622.png
|appearance = [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Sakura has rather high damage for a street fighter collaboration enemy, and also a [[Omni Strike]] that pierces up to 350 range. She has rather slow attack frequency for a street fighter collaboration enemy and can easily be stalled with meatshields due to her long backswing.

==Strategy==
Generic backliners can snipe her relatively easily, but you can also use her low damage per hit to chain attacks from rushers like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] in lower magnifications. Otherwise, [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dual]] [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragons]] + [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] get the job done.

